@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC09 Kiem duyet va quan ly hinh anh

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - MediaLibraryPage tab Hinh anh" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nMediaController + CmsMediaController + MediaService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nMediaRepository + PoiRepository + DbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo danh sach va preview anh
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc anh theo bo loc
Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen quan ly noi dung
Business -> DataAccess: Doc media va POI lien quan
DataAccess -> Database: Doc MediaFile va Poi
Database --> DataAccess: Tra danh sach
DataAccess --> Business: Tra ket qua
Business --> UI: Hien thi anh va trang thai

alt Duyet anh
  Actor -> UI: Chon Duyet
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau approve
  Business -> DataAccess: Doc media can duyet
  DataAccess -> Database: Doc MediaFile
  Database --> DataAccess: Tra media
  alt Media ton tai va hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi Approved, reviewer va thoi diem
    DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat MediaFile
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra anh da duyet
  else Khong tim thay hoac sai loai
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
else Tu choi anh
  Actor -> UI: Nhap ly do tu choi
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau reject
  alt Ly do hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi Rejected va ly do
    DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat MediaFile
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra anh bi tu choi
  else Thieu ly do
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
else Xoa hoac khoi phuc anh
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau xoa/khoi phuc
  Business -> DataAccess: Doi co IsDeleted
  DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat MediaFile
  Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
  Business --> UI: Tra ket qua
end
UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach hoac hien thi loi
@enduml
